      "side": 1,
      "message": "I keep getting:\n```\npackages/modules/Connectivity/service/src/com/android/server/connectivity/PermissionMonitor.java:289: error: cannot find symbol\n            mPermissionManager.addOnPermissionsChangeListener(new PermissionChangeListener());\n```\nwhen using the permissionmanager API; it only builds using the packagemanger, which appears to delegate to the permissionmanager anyways. Am I missing some dependency?",
