      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T21:51:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay I see how that makes sense. However it *requires* that PermissionManager is offering the callbacks and answering the synchronous queries on the same thread, or otherwise has synchronization between them (otherwise you have cross-thread visibility problems). This is not a common pattern in Android : did you check that this is the case in PermissionManager ? To give you an example, this would not be correct in the case of NetworkCallbacks because there is no such synchronization.",
      "parentUuid": "55aebac7_ac4a6b5c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 287,
        "startChar": 28,
