      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T21:51:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hah, it seems the PermissionManager method was slated to become SystemApi in 2020 (according to blame of that file) but the @SystemApi tag has never been uncommented. This also solves the question I had in the back of my mind where PackageManager.addOnPermissionChangeListener is @Deprecated... but it\u0027s commented out. I think all of this was planned and never executed.\n\nSo operatively, your current code seems best, and the method is not actually deprecated after all. Resolving this comment.",
